I configured a multi-router BGP topology using Cisco IOS. Configured internal BGP routing within AS 65000, established an eBGP peering with AS 65001, and advertised internal prefixes toward the Internet. Used static routes with ip route to ensure required networks were present in the routing table for BGP network statements. Verified BGP route propagation and end-to-end connectivity to a remote Internet server at 15.0.0.1.
